# Title: Invoke-Obfuscation Via Use Rundll32 - System
# ID: 641a4bfb-c017-44f7-800c-2aee0184ce9b
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Nikita Nazarov, oscd.community
# Date: 2020-10-09
# Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1027, attack.execution, attack.t1059.001
# Description: Detects Obfuscated Powershell via use Rundll32 in Scripts
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog (Provider_Name="Service Control Manager" AND EventID=7045 AND (ImagePath="*&&*" AND ImagePath="*rundll32*" AND ImagePath="*shell32.dll*" AND ImagePath="*shellexec_rundll*") AND (ImagePath="*value*" OR ImagePath="*invoke*" OR ImagePath="*comspec*" OR ImagePath="*iex*"))
